  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing E-Justice for Inclusive Legal Empowerment and Improved Access to Legal Aid for Marginalized Women and Men in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects overarching goal is to promote inclusive legal empowerment and improve access to legal aid for marginalized individuals in Albania by harnessing the capabilities of cutting-edge digital tools and technology. It endeavors to facilitate the extensive digitalization of the Free Legal Aid scheme, integrating features like an innovative web-based free legal aid application, the e-legal service platform (juristionline.al) linked to FLAD, and an AI-powered chatbot. This holistic strategy</narrative>
  </description>
